---
import Legal from "../components/Legal.astro";
import { site } from "../config";
---

<Legal
  kicker="Terms"
  title="Terms, EyesRhythm"
  description="A $12 copy of EyesRhythm for one computer, macOS or Windows."
  heading="A copy for one computer."
  lede="Simple terms for buying EyesRhythm from this site."
>
  <p>
    You are buying a packaged copy of EyesRhythm for macOS or Windows. {site.price.label}{" "}
    one time. No subscription. One operating system, not both. One computer.
  </p>
  <p>
    After you pay, you get a license key and that OS’s installer by email. On
    first launch you register the key. After that the app stays on your
    machine.
  </p>
  <p>
    The key is for you. Please do not share or resell it. A Mac key will not
    unlock Windows, and a Windows key will not unlock Mac.
  </p>
  <p>
    EyesRhythm watches blink rhythm through your camera, on this computer. It
    is a wellness companion. It is not a medical device, and it is not meant
    to diagnose, treat, or prevent disease.
  </p>
  <p>
    You need a working webcam and a current macOS or Windows version. Camera
    permission is yours to give. Without it, the companion cannot count blinks.
    {site.recommendedMachine}
  </p>
  <p>
    Try it for 7 days. If you find the app not worth it, please let us know
    the reason. Mail{" "}
    <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a> from the
    same email address you used during purchase. Details are on the{" "}
    <a href="/refund">refunds</a> page.
  </p>
  <p>
    Questions:{" "}
    <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a>.
  </p>
</Legal>
